  "description": "Last Update: 03 July 2025",
  "body_html": "<p>The sole purpose of this document is for you to have a list of pre-screened stocks to select from. If we get too many subscribers, I will find an alternative method for distributing the daily signals. Feel free to ping me in the chat with any questions, Monday through Friday, during market hours. <strong>The top picks generally perform the best! </strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Q7i!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5863b5ce-2427-4fa1-8142-22c74063ef9b_2718x1490.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Q7i!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5863b5ce-2427-4fa1-8142-22c74063ef9b_2718x1490.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Q7i!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5863b5ce-2427-4fa1-8142-22c74063ef9b_2718x1490.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Q7i!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5863b5ce-2427-4fa1-8142-22c74063ef9b_2718x1490.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Q7i!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5863b5ce-2427-4fa1-8142-22c74063ef9b_2718x1490.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Q7i!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5863b5ce-2427-4fa1-8142-22c74063ef9b_2718x1490.png\" width=\"14